estion":"What assets are available on the iTrustCapital software platform?","answer":"\u003cp\u003eVisit our \u003ca href=\"/markets\" target=\"_self\"\u003eMarkets\u003c/a\u003e page to see available tradable assets on the iTrustCapital platform.\u003c/p\u003e"}},{"faq_id":{"id":"7","question":"What is the minimum and maximum per account?","answer":"\u003cdiv class=\"faq-item selected-item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"collapse show\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"faq-body\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe minimum to open an iTrust account is $1,000. The maximum to fund an account is based on IRS limitations for cash contributions. There is no maximum for IRA Transfers or Qualified Plan Rollovers.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e"}},{"faq_id":{"id":"17","question":"What are the tax benefits of having an iTrustCapital Crypto IRA?","answer":"\u003cdiv class=\"collapse show\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"faq-body\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAn iTrustCapital Crypto IRA is an investment vehicle that allows investors to buy and sell cryptocurrencies within a regulated retirement account. There are two main types of IRAs: Traditional and Roth, each offering unique tax benefits*.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eContributions to Traditional IRAs may be tax-deductible, and investments grow tax-deferred. In Roth IRAs, contributions are after-tax, but withdrawals are tax-free, benefiting crypto investors expecting asset appreciation over time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e*Some additional taxes and conditions may apply. Capital gains tax implications vary depending on individual financial circumstances.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e"}},{"faq_id":{"id":"6","question":"What is the difference between having an iTrustCapital Crypto IRA vs an exchange like Coinbase?","answer":"\u003cdiv class=\"faq-item selected-item\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"collapse show\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"faq-body\"\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eTypically, when you buy and sell Crypto through a crypto exchange, it\u0026rsquo;s considered a non-sheltered, taxable account. That means every time you take profits or adjust your holdings, you could trigger capital gains taxes, often without even realizing it. Over time, those taxes can quietly reduce your net returns.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eWith a self-directed iTrustCapital Crypto IRA, there are key advantages:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003ePotentially grow your crypto tax-deferred (Traditional) or tax-free (Roth), depending on the type of IRA you choose.*\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003eAvoid yearly capital gains reporting, which means less paperwork and more time focused on your portfolio.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"\u003eBuild long-term wealth without letting short-term tax hits disrupt your growth potential.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e*Some additional taxes and conditions may apply. Capital gains tax implications vary depending on individual financial circumstances.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e"}}]},"carousel":{"id":"1","slug":"home","theme":"glass_simple","image_only":false,"slides_per_view":1,"autoplay":false,"label":null,"css":null,"content":[{"carousel_content_id":{"id":"76","header":"USC Game Day Getaway! Enter to Win!","text":"One lucky winner will enjoy an amazing USC experience trip, while runner up winners will get an Apple iPad Air or a $200 gift card.","links":[{"cta_links_id":{"id":"74","text":"Enter Here","