d":"562","title":"Can I Stake Crypto in an IRA?","description":"There’s a feature that allows some crypto holders to earn passive rewards, similar to dividends or interest.  It’s called staking.","slug":"can-i-stake-crypto-in-an-ira","preview_image":{"id":"7ac1b601-911f-4e90-8561-a21c1adc8f1f","description":"Piggy bank with plant growing on top with title, Can I stake Crypto in an IRA?"},"content_video_url":null},"learn_content_settings":["img","title","description","link","button"]}},{"carousel_content_id":{"id":"22","header":"The Benefits of an IRA","text":"Learn how IRAs offer flexible and tax-efficient ways to save and invest for retirement, and why many investors include them in their broader financial strategies.","links":[{"cta_links_id":{"id":"27","text":"Learn More","icon":null,"theme":"green","size":"md","url":"/learn/why-open-a-self-directed-ira","target":null,"open_video_player":false,"css":null}}],"preview_image":null,"url":null,"target":null,"open_video_player":false,"learn_content":{"id":"192","title":"The Benefits of an IRA","description":"IRAs offer flexible and tax-efficient ways to save and invest for retirement, which is why many investors include them in their broader financial strategies","slug":"why-open-a-self-directed-ira","preview_image":{"id":"2dbdc679-cdb0-48c8-8894-78412257c832","description":"Headline: The Benefits of an IRA."},"content_video_url":null},"learn_content_settings":["img","link"]}}]},"liveCurrencies":{"data":[{"id":"74","name":"1inch Network","slug":"1inch","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"1INCH","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe 1inch Network's first protocol is a decentralized exchange (DEX) aggregator solution that searches deals across multiple liquidity sources, offering users better rates than any individual exchange. The 1inch Aggregation Protocol incorporates the Pathfinder algorithm for finding the best paths across over 400+ liquidity sources on 12 chains.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"4","name":"ApeCoin","slug":"ape-coin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"APE","description":"\u003cp\u003eApeCoin is an ERC-20 governance and utility token used within the APE Ecosystem to empower and incentivize a decentralized community building at the forefront of web3.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"107","name":"Pudgy Penguins","slug":"pudgy-penguins","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"PENGU","description":"\u003cp\u003ePudgy Penguins (PENGU) is a native token of the Pudgy Penguins ecosystem, known for its unique and charming penguin NFTs. PENGU adds utility across the ecosystem and has grown in popularity alongside the brand\u0026rsquo;s rise in the NFT space.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"112","name":"World Liberty Financial","slug":"world-liberty-financial","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"WLFI","description":"\u003cp\u003eWorld Liberty Financial (WLF), backed by Donald Trump and family, is a DeFi platform bridging traditional finance and blockchain. It promotes U.S. dollar dominance through lending, borrowing, and a USD1 stablecoin. The WLFI token enables holders to vote on platform decisions, built on protocols like Aave V3.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"133","name":"XDC Network","slug":"xdc-network","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"XDC","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe XDC Network is a blockchain platform purpose-built for global trade finance and the tokenization of real-world assets (RWAs). Fully compatible with the Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM), it operates on an advanced Delegated Proof of Stake (DPoS) consensus mechanism, ensuring strong security, rapid transaction processing, and scalable performance.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"140","name":"Aster","slug":"aster","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ASTER","description":"\u003cp\u003eAster is a multichain decentralized exchange that supports both spot and perpetual trading across multiple blockchains. It aims to combine the speed and user experience of centralized exchanges (CEXs) with the self-custody and transparency of decentralized finance. ASTER is the platform\u0026rsquo;s native cryptocurrency, used for governance, staking, and transaction fees within the Aster ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"97","name":"AIOZ Network","slug":"aioz-network","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"AIOZ","description":"\u003cp\u003eAIOZ Network is a decentralized platform for Web3 storage, AI computation, and streaming services. It utilizes a global network of personal devices (DePINs), allowing users to contribute computing power and earn rewards. The AIOZ token powers the ecosystem, facilitating transactions, incentives, and access to decentralized services.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"44","name":"Gala","slug":"gala","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"GALA","description":"\u003cp\u003eGala is a specific type of blockchain gaming platform built on Ethereum. It functions as a play-to-earn (p2e) platform, offering incentives for users to continuously interact with the games. The native token, GALA is used to purchase NFTs which can be applied to the specific games users are playing.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"75","name":"Sui","slug":"sui","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SUI","description":"\u003cp\u003eSui is a groundbreaking layer-1 blockchain platform designed to support the needs of global adoption by offering a secure, powerful, and scalable development platform. At its core, Sui leverages a novel object-centric data model and the secure Move programming language to address inefficiencies prevalent in existing blockchain architectures.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"113","name":"Cronos","slug":"cronos","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"CRO","description":"\u003cp\u003eCronos is an EVM-compatible Layer-1 blockchain built by Crypto.com on the Cosmos SDK, designed for DeFi, NFTs, and gaming dApps. It offers high-speed transactions, low fees, and interoperability with Ethereum and Cosmos via the IBC protocol. Its native token, CRO, is used for transaction fees, staking for network security and rewards, governance voting, and accessing Crypto.com ecosystem benefits like trading fee discounts.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"134","name":"BNB","slug":"bnb","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"BNB","description":"\u003cp\u003eBNB (BNB) is the native cryptocurrency of the BNB Chain, developed by Binance, one of the world\u0026rsquo;s largest crypto exchanges. It was originally launched on Ethereum as an ERC-20 token before migrating to Binance\u0026rsquo;s own blockchain network. BNB is used to pay transaction fees, participate in staking, and access a wide range of DeFi apps and services across the BNB ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"141","name":"Mantle","slug":"mantle","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"MNT","description":"\u003cp\u003eMantle is an Ethereum Layer 2 network and one of the largest ZK rollups, designed to make transactions faster and more cost-efficient. It uses a modular architecture that separates transaction execution, data availability, and finality into distinct layers, and integrates EigenLayer\u0026rsquo;s data-availability solution, EigenDA, to help maintain low transaction fees. MNT is the native token of the Mantle network, used for governance, staking, and supporting the platform\u0026rsquo;s economic security.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"3","name":"Algorand","slug":"algorand","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ALGO","description":"\u003cp\u003eAlgorand (ALGO) is a self-sustaining, decentralized, blockchain-based network that supports a wide range of applications. These systems are secure, scalable, and efficient, all critical properties for effective applications in the real world. Algorand will support computations that require reliable performance guarantees to create new forms of trust. The Algorand mainnet became live in June 2019 and was able to handle almost 1 million transactions per day as of December 2020.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"100","name":"Berachain","slug":"berachain","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"BERA","description":"\u003cp\u003eBerachain (BERA) is a Layer 1 blockchain designed for seamless app development and migration for developers. It uses a Proof of Liquidity (PoL) consensus mechanism to keep the network secure while rewarding liquidity providers. BERA, the native cryptocurrency, is primarily used for transaction fees and staking within the Berachain ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"101","name":"Story","slug":"story-protocol","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"IP","description":"\u003cp\u003eStory Protocol (IP) is a Layer 1 blockchain built to transform intellectual property (IP) into a tokenized and programmable asset. It allows creators to register, license, and monetize their IP while leveraging blockchain technology. The network\u0026rsquo;s native cryptocurrency, IP, is used for transaction fees, IP registrations, governance participation, and staking to support network security.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"105","name":"Celestia","slug":"celestia","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"TIA","description":"\u003cp class=\"\"\u003eCelestia (TIA) is the first modular blockchain network that enables anyone to easily deploy their own blockchain with minimal overhead. Celestia scales by rethinking blockchain architecture from the ground up. It is a minimal blockchain that decouples execution from consensus by introducing a new primitive, data availability sampling. Since Celestia does not impose any execution or settlement constraints, developers are free to define their own execution and settlement environments. This unlocks new, unrealized possibilities for builders and developers.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"108","name":"Fartcoin","slug":"fartcoin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"FARTCOIN","description":"\u003cp\u003eFartcoin (FARTCOIN) is a meme-based token running on the Solana network. It started as an initiative on Pump.fun, a crypto launchpad that enables users to create tokens. FARTCOIN is the native token of Fartcoin.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"114","name":"Hyperliquid","slug":"hyperliquid","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"HYPE","description":"\u003cp\u003eHyperliquid is a high-performance Layer-1 blockchain built for DeFi, focusing on perpetual futures and spot markets with a fully on-chain order book, delivering sub-second transaction finality and up to 200,000 orders per second via HyperBFT consensus. It supports Ethereum-compatible smart contracts through HyperEVM, enabling dApps and cross-chain asset transfers with bridges like Arbitrum. The native token, HYPE, is used for transaction fees, staking for network security, governance voting, and fee discounts within the ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"142","name":"USD Coin","slug":"usdc","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"USDC","description":"\u003cp\u003eUSD Coin (USDC) is a digital asset known as a stablecoin, created to maintain a one-to-one value with the United States dollar. Instead of existing as physical cash, USDC operates entirely on blockchain networks and functions as a digital form of USD that can move quickly and securely online. Many people use USDC for payments, transfers, and storing value.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"7","name":"Axie Infinity","slug":"axie-infinity","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"AXS","description":"\u003cp\u003eAxie Infinity is a blockchain-based game powered on Ethereum where players can battle, collect, and build a digital kingdom for their pets. The game consists of players collecting Axies that function as battling pets. Players can use their Axies to battle other players, breed new Axies, and traverse the game universe. The native token of Axie Infinity, AXS, is an ERC20 governance token and serves as a currency that gives holders a vote in the future of Axie Infinity\u0026rsquo;s development.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"109","name":"Peanut the Squirrel","slug":"peanut-the-squirrel","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"PNUT","description":"\u003cp\u003ePeanut the Squirrel is a meme-based Solana Program Library (SPL) token on the Solana/ blockchain, inspired by the internet-famous pet squirrel, Peanut. Designed to foster community engagement and online fun, PNUT serves as the native token of the Peanut the Squirrel project.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"106","name":"Jito","slug":"jito","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"JTO","description":"\u003cp class=\"\"\u003eJito Network is a major contributor to the Solana ecosystem through its JitoSOL liquid staking pool, and its collection of MEV products. Users can exchange their SOL for JitoSOL. In return, holders maintain SOL\u0026rsquo;s liquidity and DeFi opportunities while earning yield from staking. JitoSOL uniquely provides its holders with additional rewards from transaction revenue associated with MEV extraction on Solana.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"110","name":"Marinade","slug":"mnde","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"MNDE","description":"\u003cp\u003eMarinade is a decentralized finance (DeFi) protocol built on the Solana blockchain. It enables liquid staking of SOL, allowing users to stake their tokens and receive mSOL in return. Over time, mSOL accrues staking rewards. MNDE is the native governance token of the Marinade protocol.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"102","name":"Bittensor","slug":"bittensor","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"TAO","description":"\u003cp\u003eBittensor (TAO) is a Layer 1 blockchain protocol that utilizes blockchain technology to create a decentralized machine learning network. In this system, models improve through shared contributions, and the native cryptocurrency TAO is used to facilitate transactions and incentivize participants who contribute their computational resources and expertise.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"115","name":"Sky","slug":"sky","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SKY","description":"\u003cp\u003eSky Protocol is the evolution of MakerDAO, a decentralized lending and borrowing system where users lock up collateral to mint USDS, its overcollateralized stablecoin. SKY is the native governance token of the protocol, upgraded from MakerDAO\u0026rsquo;s MKR. It enables decentralized decision-making, supports ecosystem development, and powers mechanisms like the Smart Burn Engine, activation rewards, and Sky Stars, which distribute USDS and token incentives to active participants.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"136","name":"Dash","slug":"dash","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"DASH","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong id=\"docs-internal-guid-f4ee29dd-7fff-95d7-8851-00dd09e408bd\"\u003eDash (DASH) is an open-source blockchain and digital currency designed for fast, low-cost global payments. Originally inspired by Bitcoin, Dash enhances the model by offering quicker transaction speeds and optional privacy features. DASH is the native cryptocurrency powering the Dash network.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"143","name":"Canton","slug":"canton","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"CC","description":"\u003cp\u003eCanton is a privacy-enabled open blockchain network designed to support secure, scalable financial applications. Powered by unique smart contract technology, it allows participants to exchange data and value while preserving privacy, unlocking the full potential of synchronized financial markets. Canton Coin (CC) is the native cryptocurrency of the Canton network, used to power transactions and support network operations.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"104","name":"Axelar","slug":"axelar","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"AXL","description":"\u003cp class=\"\"\u003eAxelar claims to deliver \u0026ldquo;secure cross-chain communication for Web3.\u0026rdquo; The project provides a decentralized network and tools to help builders of decentralized applications (dApps) with seamless cross-chain communication through its protocol suite, tools and APIs. Axelar features three core components \u0026ndash; a decentralized network, a software development kit of protocols and APIs, and a set of gateway smart contracts for cross-chain connectivity.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"23","name":"Chainlink","slug":"chainlink","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"LINK","description":"\u003cp\u003eChainlink is a decentralized oracle network that bridges blockchains with external data sources, such as financial market data, weather reports, supply chain details, and more. It enables smart contracts to execute automatically by providing them with real-world information. The network's native currency, LINK, functions as an ERC-20 token on the Ethereum network, ensuring compatibility with Ethereum's currencies and smart contracts.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"90","name":"Sei","slug":"sei","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SEI","description":"\u003cp\u003eSei Network is a Layer 1 blockchain network optimized for decentralized exchanges, offering enhanced performance and liquidity. SEI is the native cryptocurrency of the Sei Network, used primarily for paying transaction fees and participating in network operations.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"103","name":"Optimism","slug":"optimism","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"OP","description":"\u003cp\u003eOptimism (OP) is a layer-two blockchain on top of Ethereum. Optimism benefits from the security of the Ethereum mainnet and helps scale the Ethereum ecosystem by using optimistic rollups. That means transactions are trustlessly recorded on Optimism but ultimately secured on Ethereum.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"111","name":"ZKSync","slug":"zksync","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ZK","description":"\u003cp\u003eZKSync is a Layer 2 scaling solution for Ethereum that utilizes zero-knowledge rollups (zk-rollups). These rollups bundle multiple transactions and submit a single cryptographic proof to the Ethereum mainnet, enabling faster, cheaper, and secure transactions. ZK is the native token of the ZKSync ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"116","name":"Zcash","slug":"zcash","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ZEC","description":"\u003cp\u003eZcash is a decentralized, open-source cryptocurrency launched in October 2016 to prioritize privacy and security in digital transactions using zero-knowledge encryption. Built as an alternative to Bitcoin, it enhances financial confidentiality by offering optional anonymity, allowing users to shield transaction details that would otherwise be publicly visible on the blockchain. ZEC is the native cryptocurrency of the Zcash network, used to facilitate transactions and maintain its privacy-preserving ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"137","name":"Starknet","slug":"starknet","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"STRK","description":"\u003cp\u003eStarknet is a Layer 2 validity rollup on Ethereum that uses zero-knowledge proofs to make transactions faster and cheaper. It uses STARKs (Scalable Transparent Arguments of Knowledge), a type of proof that enables the verification of many transactions in a single proof without revealing underlying data. The STRK token is used for governance, staking to help secure the network, and paying transaction fees.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"144","name":"LayerZero","slug":"layerzero","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ZRO","description":"\u003cp\u003eLayerZero is an omnichain interoperability protocol that enables direct, secure messaging and asset transfers between different blockchain networks. It serves as a foundational cross-chain communication layer, allowing decentralized applications to operate seamlessly across multiple chains without relying on fragmented traditional bridges or separate liquidity pools. ZRO is the native governance and utility token of the LayerZero protocol.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"94","name":"Echelon Prime","slug":"echelon-prime","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"PRIME","description":"\u003cp\u003eEchelon Prime is a decentralized Web3 platform focused on gaming, with its flagship product being Parallel, a blockchain-based trading card game. The native token, PRIME, is used within Parallel for various functions and serves as an example of blockchain integration in gaming. It is also designed for use in other blockchain-enabled games.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"2","name":"Cardano","slug":"cardano","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ADA","description":"\u003cp\u003eCardano is a blockchain platform built on the proof-of-stake consensus protocol, Ouroboros, which validates transactions efficiently with low energy consumption. Designed for scalability, sustainability, and adaptability, it supports smart contract execution and the creation of decentralized applications on its network. The blockchain\u0026rsquo;s native currency, ADA, powers Cardano, facilitating transaction fee payments and enabling staking to enhance network security and stability in return for rewards.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"138","name":"Aerodrome Finance","slug":"aerodrome-finance","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"AERO","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eAerodrome Finance is a decentralized exchange (DEX) built on the Base blockchain and operates as an automated market maker (AMM) for seamless token swaps. Users can supply tokens to liquidity pools to become liquidity providers (LPs), earning a share of the trading fees generated by each pool. AERO is the native token of Aerodrome Finance, used for governance, incentivizing liquidity provision, and participating in the protocol\u0026rsquo;s emissions and reward structure.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"80","name":"Artificial Superintelligence Alliance","slug":"artificial-superintelligence-alliance","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"FET","description":"\u003cp\u003eArtificial Superintelligence Alliance is a decentralized platform built on the Ethereum network, designed to facilitate machine learning and artificial intelligence in a decentralized manner. The platform's native token allows users to interact with AI-powered autonomous agents, pay for services, and participate in governance by staking tokens to help secure the network.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"85","name":"Lido DAO","slug":"lido-dao","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"LDO","description":"\u003cp\u003eLido DAO is a decentralized autonomous organization overseeing the Lido protocol, one of the largest providers of liquid staking for Ethereum. The governance token, LDO, allows holders to participate in decision-making processes, including protocol updates and governance proposals.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"86","name":"Metis","slug":"metisdao","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"METIS","description":"\u003cp\u003eMetisDAO is a Layer 2 scaling solution on Ethereum, aimed at addressing the blockchain trilemma of scalability, security, and decentralization. The network facilitates faster and more cost-effective transaction processing. Its native token, METIS, is used for paying transaction fees and accessing services on the network.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"87","name":"Moodeng","slug":"moodeng","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"MOODENG","description":"\u003cp\u003eMOODENG is a meme coin inspired by Moo Deng, a pygmy hippopotamus residing in Thailand. At just two months old, Moo Deng captured the internet\u0026rsquo;s attention when her photos and videos went viral, turning her into an online sensation.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"81","name":"Floki","slug":"floki","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"FLOKI","description":"\u003cp\u003eFloki is a multi-chain token available as an ERC-20 token on the Ethereum blockchain and as a BEP-20 token on the Binance Smart Chain (BSC). Inspired by Elon Musk's Shiba Inu named Floki, it operates on these existing blockchain networks without its own dedicated protocol or blockchain.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"84","name":"Injective","slug":"injective","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"INJ","description":"\u003cp\u003eInjective is an open-source Layer 1 blockchain designed for building robust and interoperable decentralized applications (dApps). The network's native cryptocurrency, INJ, is used for staking to help secure the blockchain and for governance decisions within the protocol.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"93","name":"Helium","slug":"helium","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"HNT","description":"\u003cp\u003eHelium is a decentralized blockchain network built to support the Internet of Things (IoT). Its mainnet enables low-powered wireless devices to communicate and transmit data through a network of nodes called Hotspots. Participants who run Hotspots are rewarded with the native cryptocurrency, HNT, through mining and maintaining network infrastructure.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"98","name":"Ondo","slug":"ondo","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ONDO","description":"\u003cp\u003eOndo is a decentralized finance (DeFi) platform focused on institutional-grade tokenized assets and on-chain liquidity solutions. It provides risk-isolated, fixed-yield loans backed by yield-generating crypto assets. The ONDO token serves as the platform's governance token, allowing holders to vote on protocol upgrades, DAO management, and other key decisions.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"96","name":"Sonic","slug":"sonic","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"S","description":"\u003cp\u003eSonic is an EVM layer-1 platform that offers developers attractive incentives and powerful infrastructure. The chain provides over 10,000 TPS and sub-second confirmation times, powering the next generation of decentralized applications. Sonic's Fee Monetization (FeeM) program rewards developers with up to 90% of the fees their apps generate, adapting the Web2 ad-revenue model to a decentralized framework. Developers now directly profit from their app's traffic and user engagement. Furthermore, the Sonic Gateway provides developers and users with seamless access to vast liquidity through a native, secure bridge connected to Ethereum. With a unique fail-safe mechanism, it ensures your assets are protected in all circumstances.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"99","name":"Flare","slug":"flare","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"FLR","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlare (FLR) is a Layer 1 blockchain compatible with the Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM). Its goal is to provide developers with decentralized access to reliable data from external blockchains and the internet. The native cryptocurrency, FLR, is used for transaction fees and validator node participation.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"92","name":"VeChain","slug":"vechain","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"VET","description":"\u003cp\u003eVeChain is a Layer 1 blockchain platform designed to optimize business operations and enhance supply chain management through product tracking and process transparency. By utilizing smart contracts, it enables the development of decentralized applications (dApps) on its network. The native cryptocurrency, VET, is used for transactions and accessing network services.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"91","name":"Stacks","slug":"stacks","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"STX","description":"\u003cp\u003eStacks is a blockchain platform designed to bring smart contracts and decentralized applications to Bitcoin. By building on Bitcoin's security, Stacks enables these features without modifying Bitcoin itself. The platform's native token, STX, is used for network fees, executing LDO smart contracts, and participating in governance.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"89","name":"Popcat","slug":"popcat","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"POPCAT","description":"\u003cp\u003ePopcat (POPCAT) is a meme coin inspired by the viral \u0026ldquo;Popcat\u0026rdquo; meme, which features a cat with a wide-open mouth in a comical popping motion. This meme became an internet favorite, spreading across platforms as users celebrated its simple yet hilarious charm.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"82","name":"Gigachad","slug":"gigachad","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"GIGA","description":"\u003cp\u003eGIGA is a meme token launched on the Solana blockchain. Inspired by Ernest Khalimov, the iconic Gigachad channels the strength, confidence, and humor of internet culture, driven by its community.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"88","name":"Orca","slug":"orca","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ORCA","description":"\u003cp\u003eOrca is a decentralized exchange (DEX) built on the Solana network, offering an automated market maker (AMM) platform for swapping assets, earning yield, and providing liquidity. Its governance token, ORCA, is used to support the growth and operations of the Orca protocol, enabling trading and community participation.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"1","name":"Aave","slug":"aave","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"AAVE","description":"\u003cp\u003eAave is a decentralized lending and borrowing protocol that operates on the Ethereum network. Users of the Aave protocol can participate either as depositors, providing liquidity to the market to earn passive income, or as borrowers, able to borrow crypto assets in exchange for paying a variable interest rate. AAVE, the native asset of Aave, is an ERC-20 token that facilitates the protocol's operations.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"79","name":"Aptos","slug":"aptos","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"APT","description":"\u003cp\u003eAptos is a Layer 1 blockchain that uses a Proof of Stake (PoS) consensus mechanism. It leverages a unique programming language called Move, developed by former Meta engineers, to enable efficient and secure smart contract functionality. The native cryptocurrency, APT, can be used for governance, staking, and paying transaction fees on the network.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"73","name":"Arbitrum","slug":"arbitrum","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ARB","description":"\u003cp\u003eArbitrum is a Layer 2 scaling solution designed to enhance Ethereum's capabilities by optimizing transaction speed and reducing costs using Optimistic Rollup technology. It supports the seamless transition of Ethereum-based DApps, maintaining compatibility and efficiency. Arbitrum also introduced the ARB token, which enables holders to participate in network governance, decentralizing the platform's management and evolution.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"67","name":"Bonk","slug":"bonk","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"BONK","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eBonk (BONK) is a decentralized memecoin on the Solana blockchain, known for its dog-themed design. As the native token of the Bonk ecosystem, it was launched to engage and empower the Solana community. BONK has quickly gained popularity and has been integrated into various platforms.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"68","name":"Pepe","slug":"pepe","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"PEPE","description":"\u003cp\u003ePepe (PEPE) is a meme-based token built on the Ethereum blockchain. Launched in April 2023, it leverages the popularity of the Pepe the Frog meme to gain traction in the crypto community. As an ERC-20 token, PEPE uses a deflationary mechanism to burn a small percentage of tokens with each transaction and initially employed a redistribution system to reward holders.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"69","name":"Render","slug":"render","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"RENDER","description":"\u003cp\u003eRender (RNDR) is a decentralized, blockchain-based network that connects users with unused GPU power to those needing significant computational resources for digital rendering tasks. By facilitating secure and transparent transactions via blockchain, Render supports a variety of applications, including video game graphics, virtual reality, and AI model training. The RNDR token, an ERC-20 token on the Ethereum blockchain, serves as the platform\u0026rsquo;s token for compensating GPU providers and paying for rendering services.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"70","name":"Dogwifhat","slug":"dogwifhat","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"WIF","description":"\u003cp\u003edogwifhat (WIF) is a meme-based cryptocurrency operating on the Solana blockchain, featuring a Shiba Inu puppy wearing a pink hat as its iconic symbol. WIF, the native token, quickly gained popularity due to its charming meme origin and strong community support. The token operates with a fixed supply of 998.9 million.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"72","name":"NEAR Protocol","slug":"near-protocol","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"NEAR","description":"\u003cp\u003eNear Protocol (NEAR) is a decentralized, layer-1 blockchain network designed to provide a scalable and user-friendly platform for decentralized applications (dApps). Utilizing a Proof of Stake (PoS) consensus mechanism and innovative sharding technology called Nightshade, Near Protocol enhances transaction speeds and cost efficiency, making it a strong competitor to other blockchain networks. The platform\u0026rsquo;s native asset, NEAR, is used for transaction fees, staking, and governance, ensuring the network\u0026rsquo;s security and functionality.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"76","name":"Immutable","slug":"immutable","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"IMX","description":"\u003cp\u003eImmutable positions itself as the first layer-two scaling solution for NFTs on Ethereum. According to Immutable, its blockchain does away with Ethereum\u0026rsquo;s limitations like low scalability, a poor user experience, illiquidity, and a slow developer experience. Instead, users benefit from instant trading and massive scalability while enjoying zero gas fees for minting and trading NFTs without compromising user or asset security.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"45","name":"Chiliz","slug":"chiliz","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"CHZ","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eChiliz is a blockchain-based platform that focuses on the sports industry, enabling a new kind of engagement between fans and their favorite sports team. It operates the blockchain-based sports entertainment platform Socios, which enables users to participate in the governance of their favorite sports brands. CHZ is the native token for Chiliz that currently powers Socios.com, ChilizX, and the Chiliz Chain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"77","name":"Filecoin","slug":"filecoin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"FIL","description":"\u003cp\u003eFilecoin is open-source and decentralized, which means that all governance is in the hands of the community. On the Filecoin platform, developers have the opportunity to create cloud file storage services like Dropbox or iCloud. Anyone can join Filecoin and start storing their data or earn money by providing space for someone else's funds. The creators of Filecoin opted for their blockchain technology to run the network and their token with their own consensus.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"78","name":"Internet Computer","slug":"internet-computer","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ICP","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Internet Computer blockchain incorporates a radical rethink of blockchain design, powered by innovations in cryptography. It provides the first \u0026ldquo;World Computer\u0026rdquo; blockchain that can be used to build almost any online system or service, including demanding web social media, without need for traditional IT such as cloud computing services. As such it can enable full end-to-end decentralization.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"6","name":"Avalanche","slug":"avalanche","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"AVAX","description":"\u003cp\u003eAvalanche is a blockchain platform enabling smart contracts and decentralized applications. It tackles the blockchain trilemma by balancing scalability, security, and decentralization through a unique multi-chain structure: the Exchange Chain (X-Chain), Contract Chain (C-Chain), and Platform Chain (P-Chain). Its native currency, AVAX, fuels the network, covering transaction fees and allowing for staking to secure the network in exchange for rewards.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"8","name":"Basic Attention Token","slug":"basic-attention-token","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"BAT","description":"\u003cp\u003eBrave Software's blockchain-based digital advertising platform revolutionizes the interaction between users and ads on the internet. Brave's native token (BAT), an ERC-20 token, powers this ecosystem. Users browsing the web with Brave's free web browser, available at Brave.com, can choose to replace standard ads with those from Brave's ad network. For their attention, users receive BAT tokens from advertisers as compensation.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"10","name":"Bitcoin","slug":"bitcoin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"BTC","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eBitcoin, the world\u0026rsquo;s first cryptocurrency, operates as a peer-to-peer digital currency system enabling decentralized financial transactions. Brought online in 2009 by Satoshi Nakamoto, Bitcoin allows users to securely and anonymously transact its native currency, bitcoin (BTC), without the need for a central intermediary. Only 21 million bitcoin will ever be in existence.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"9","name":"Bitcoin Cash","slug":"bitcoin-cash","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"BCH","description":"\u003cp\u003eBitcoin Cash is a blockchain network created from a hard fork of the Bitcoin Network. It aims to improve scalability and speed by increasing the block size, facilitating more transactions, and making it more useful for everyday use. The network's native cryptocurrency, BCH, is positioned as an alternative to BTC for daily transactions, rather than merely a store of value.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"19","name":"Ethereum","slug":"ethereum","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ETH","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003eEthereum is a decentralized blockchain-based global platform, serving as the foundation for an ecosystem of interoperable decentralized applications. It relies on automated smart contracts, allowing applications and assets to operate without a central authority. The network is powered by its native cryptocurrency, Ether (ETH), which is used for transaction fees and staking. Staking contributes to the network's security, and in return, participants receive rewards.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"16","name":"Enjin Coin","slug":"enjin-coin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ENJ","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnjin Coin (ENJ) is an Ethereum token that aims to \u0026ldquo;make it easy for individuals, businesses, and brands to use non-fungible tokens (NFTs).\u0026rdquo; ENJ is used to directly back the value of NFTs minted within the Enjin ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"15","name":"Polkadot","slug":"polkadot","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"DOT","description":"\u003cp\u003ePolkadot functions as a decentralized network that facilitates cross-blockchain transfers of data or assets. Its design integrates several blockchains to achieve enhanced security and scalability. \u0026nbsp;The native currency of Polkadot, DOT, acts as the governance token, enabling users to stake for network security or to connect new chains.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"14","name":"Dogecoin","slug":"dogecoin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"DOGE","description":"\u003cp\u003eDogecoin is a peer-to-peer open-sourced cryptocurrency powered by proof of work (PoW) for consensus. DOGE is the native cryptocurrency of Dogecoin, commonly known as a memecoin. Unlike Bitcoin, which is designed for scarcity, Dogecoin embraces abundance with no maximum supply limit, and 10,000 DOGE are mined each time a new block is added to its blockchain.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"13","name":"Curve DAO Token","slug":"curve-dao-token","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"CRV","description":"\u003cp\u003eCurve Finance is a decentralized exchange platform that allows users to swap between different tokens and stablecoins. It\u0026rsquo;s specifically designed so that users can exchange similar assets with incredibly low fees and slippage. The Curve Finance native token, CRV, serves as both a utility token and a governance token giving holders the right to participate in the decision-making process and vote on proposals.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"12","name":"Compound","slug":"compound","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"COMP","description":"\u003cp\u003eCompound is a decentralized application designed to enable crypto users to lend and borrow in an efficient, automated way. Compound utilizes Ethereum-based smart contracts, which are electronic contracts that are executed when certain conditions are met. Compound is powered by COMP, the native token and also the governance token of the Compound protocol.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"5","name":"Cosmos","slug":"cosmos","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ATOM","description":"\u003cp\u003eCosmos is a Proof of Stake (PoS) blockchain network that powers an ecosystem of blockchains designed to scale and interoperate with each other. The team aims to \"create an Internet of Blockchains, a network of blockchains able to communicate with each other in a decentralized way.\" ATOM, Cosmos's native currency, allows holders to stake their ATOM to support the network's maintenance, earning additional ATOM as a reward for their contribution.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"22","name":"The Graph","slug":"the-graph","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"GRT","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Graph is a decentralized indexing protocol used to collect and query blockchain data enabling the creation of a variety of blockchain applications. Its mission is to facilitate developers in accessing relevant data through open APIs, known as subgraphs, which can be built, published and queried using GraphQL to retrieve blockchain data for their decentralized applications. The native currency of The Graph, GRT, is utilized for query fee payments, staking, delegating support for network operations, and governance participation within the protocol.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"25","name":"Litecoin","slug":"litecoin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"LTC","description":"\u003cp\u003eLitecoin is a cryptocurrency blockchain network that was introduced in 2011 by Charlie Lee. It was created by forking Bitcoin's code and retains many characteristics of Bitcoin while being optimized for lower-cost transactions. LTC is the native cryptocurrency of Litecoin.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"26","name":"Decentraland","slug":"decentraland","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"MANA","description":"\u003cp\u003eDecentraland (MANA) is a virtual world that is integrated with Ethereum. On the Decentraland platform, users can explore a multifaced, user-generated landscape that incorporates real estate, gaming, and social media elements. MANA, an ERC-20 token, is the digital asset token used to pay for goods and services in Decentraland, while LAND is a non-fungible ERC 721 token that represents the ownership of virtual land.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"27","name":"Polygon Ecosystem Token","slug":"polygon-ecosystem-token","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"POL","description":"\u003cp\u003ePolygon is a blockchain designed as a multi-chain system compatible with the Ethereum network. Leveraging the Proof of Stake (PoS) consensus mechanism, it processes transactions on the Polygon chain efficiently. Its goal is to enable quicker and more cost-effective transactions on Ethereum as a Layer 2 sidechain \u0026mdash; blockchains operating parallel to the Ethereum main chain. The platform's native asset, MATIC, is an ERC-20 token that fuels the Polygon Network, serving as a scaling solution for Ethereum.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"31","name":"Shiba Inu","slug":"shiba-inu","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SHIB","description":"\u003cp\u003eShiba Inu is a decentralized, peer-to-peer ERC-20 token that operates on the Ethereum blockchain. Often regarded as an alternative to Dogecoin and dubbed the \"Dogecoin Killer,\" it adopts the Shiba Inu as its mascot. The native token of Shiba Inu is SHIB.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"30","name":"Sandbox","slug":"sandbox","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SAND","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Sandbox is a virtual world where players can build, own, and monetize their gaming experiences in the Ethereum blockchain. The Sandbox strives to bring blockchain into gaming and attract both crypto and non-crypto game enthusiasts by offering the advantages of true ownership, digital scarcity, monetization capabilities, and interoperability. The native currency, SAND, is the main utility token of the platform.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"33","name":"Solana","slug":"solana","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SOL","description":"\u003cp\u003eSolana is a decentralized blockchain platform that relies on smart contracts to host scalable decentralized applications. It aims to enhance blockchain scalability through a unique combination of proof of stake (PoS) consensus and proof of history (PoH). The network operates with its native cryptocurrency, SOL, which is used for transaction fees and staking. Staking contributes to the network's security, and in return, participants receive rewards.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"34","name":"SushiSwap","slug":"sushiswap","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"SUSHI","description":"\u003cp\u003eSushiSwap is a decentralized crypto exchange and automated market maker built on Ethereum. SUSHI, the native token, powers SushiSwap on the Ethereum Network. Holders of SUSHI can participate in community governance and stake their tokens to receive a portion of SushiSwap\u0026rsquo;s transaction fees.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"35","name":"Uniswap","slug":"uniswap","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"UNI","description":"\u003cp\u003eUniswap, a decentralized exchange platform (DEX), operates through smart contracts on the Ethereum blockchain to enable crypto asset swapping. The platform is governed by its native token, UNI, granting holders the authority to influence its development and operations. This system ensures a secure and efficient trading environment, with UNI at the core of its functionality.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"38","name":"XRP","slug":"xrp","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"XRP","description":"\u003cp\u003eXRP is the cryptocurrency used by Ripple Labs to enable transactions on the XRPL network. It acts as a bridge currency for various international currencies such as US dollars, Japanese Yen, Euros, Francs, and others within the XRP network. The network also supports remittances and is used to facilitate cross-border transactions.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"39","name":"Tezos","slug":"tezos","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"XTZ","description":"\u003cp\u003eTezos is an open-source blockchain network that supports peer-to-peer XTZ transactions in addition to an ecosystem of blockchain-based projects. Tezos supports smart contracts, which are electronic contracts that use blockchain technology to automatically execute. The native currency of Tezos, XTZ, is a governance token that allows XTZ holders to guide the development of the Tezos blockchain.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"40","name":"yearn.finance","slug":"yearn-finance","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"YFI","description":"\u003cp\u003eYearn.finance is a decentralized application, operating on Ethereum, that functions as a gateway to many yield-generating crypto products. Yearn.finance's native token, YFI, serves as a governance token, granting holders the power to influence decisions on the protocol's revenue distribution and strategic direction.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"37","name":"Stellar","slug":"stellar","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"XLM","description":"\u003cp\u003eStellar is a decentralized, blockchain-based network designed to enable cross-border payments and asset transfers. Jed McCaleb, who co-founded Mt. Gox and Ripple, established Stellar after leaving Ripple. He launched the Stellar protocol by forking from the Ripple codebase. Its native currency, XLM, fuels the Stellar payment system, covering transaction fees within the network.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"43","name":"Quant","slug":"quant","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"QNT","description":"\u003cp\u003eQuant represents a distinct distributed ledger technology (DLT) network that enables the linkage and interaction between multiple blockchains through its technology platform, Overledger. Unlike a traditional blockchain, Overledger serves as an application programming interface (API) that interconnects various blockchains. The network's native currency, QNT, powers Quant and serves as the primary means of payment for utilizing its services.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"95","name":"OFFICIAL TRUMP","slug":"official-trump","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"TRUMP","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-teams=\"true\"\u003eThe Official Trump token, also known as TRUMP, is a meme token launched by President Donald Trump on his Truth Social account.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-teams=\"true\"\u003eInvesting in cryptocurrencies and newly launched coins, such as $TRUMP, carries significant risks due to their speculative and highly volatile nature. Conduct your own research and consult with your financial and / or tax advisors to assess your risk tolerance prior to investing. Past performance is not an indication of future results. No investment is completely risk-free, and every investment carries the potential for losing some or all of the principal amount invested.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"41","name":"Flow","slug":"flow","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"FLOW","description":"\u003cp\u003eFlow is a proof of stake (PoS) blockchain designed by Dapper Labs, known for creating CryptoKitties and Dapper Wallet, and is tailored for crypto games and NFT collectibles. Its architecture assigns validator node tasks to four specialized roles\u0026mdash;collection, consensus, execution, and verification\u0026mdash;to boost efficiency and security. The native currency, FLOW, facilitates various operations across apps, games, and smart contracts, including staking, delegating, and paying transaction and storage fees.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"42","name":"Hedera","slug":"hedera","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"HBAR","description":"\u003cp\u003eHedera is an open-source, proof-of-stake (PoS) public network distinguished by its use of the asynchronous Byzantine Fault Tolerance (aBFT) hashgraph consensus algorithm, rather than traditional blockchain technology. This hashgraph approach is touted for its enhanced security, fairness, and speed. HBAR, the native currency of the Hedera Hashgraph network, powers the ecosystem, enabling users to execute transactions and operate applications.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"32","name":"Silver","slug":"silver","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"KMS","description":"\u003cp\u003eiTrustCapital utilizes VaultChain\u0026trade;, investment-grade gold and silver held physically at the Royal Canadian Mint with ownership managed via a secure blockchain distributed ledger.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"precious-metals"},{"id":"139","name":"Monad","slug":"monad","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"MON","description":"\u003cp\u003eMonad is a high-performance, EVM-compatible Layer-1 blockchain designed for speed and scalability. Built to overcome the throughput limitations of existing networks, Monad targets 10,000+ transactions per second while maintaining full compatibility with dApps and the DeFi ecosystem. MON is the native token of the Monad network, used for gas fees, staking, and governance participation.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"146","name":"Ripple USD","slug":"rlusd","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"RLUSD","description":"\u003cp\u003eRipple USD (RLUSD) is a U.S. dollar-denominated stablecoin developed by Ripple. Designed for institutional and enterprise use, RLUSD supports fast cross-border payments and is backed 1:1 by U.S. dollars and cash equivalents. It operates natively on both the XRP Ledger (XRPL) and Ethereum, providing a stable digital dollar purpose-built for global financial applications.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"21","name":"Gold","slug":"gold","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"KMG","description":"\u003cp\u003eiTrustCapital utilizes VaultChain\u0026trade;, investment-grade gold and silver held physically at the Royal Canadian Mint with ownership managed via a secure blockchain distributed ledger.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"precious-metals"},{"id":"149","name":"World","slug":"worldcoin-org","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"WLD","description":"\u003cp\u003eWorld is a digital identity and financial network designed to help users verify their humanity online through biometric verification technology. Co-founded by Sam Altman, Alex Blania, and Max Novendstern, the ecosystem supports applications focused on identity, payments, and global digital participation. WLD is the native asset associated within the World ecosystem, used to support participation, governance, and network-related utility.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"151","name":"Zebec Network","slug":"zebec-network","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"ZBCN","description":"\u003cp\u003eZebec Network (ZBCN) is a blockchain-based financial infrastructure platform focused on real-time payments, payroll, and decentralized finance solutions. Originally built on Solana to enable continuous payment streaming, Zebec has expanded into products including crypto payroll, payment cards, and treasury management tools. ZBCN is the native crypto asset used for ecosystem utility, governance, rewards, and supporting network participation across the Zebec platform.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"148","name":"Tron","slug":"tron","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"TRX","description":"\u003cp\u003eTRON is a blockchain network designed to support decentralized applications (dApps), digital asset transfers, and fast, low-cost transactions. The network powers a growing ecosystem of blockchain-based services, including payments, stablecoin activity, and decentralized finance (DeFi). TRX is the native asset of the TRON blockchain, used to pay transaction fees, interact with smart contracts, and participate in network governance.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"152","name":"Platinum","slug":"platinum","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"KMPT","description":"\u003cp\u003ePlatinum is a rare physical commodity with intrinsic value driven by both industrial demand and its status as a precious metal, making it a hybrid asset that behaves differently from traditional inflation hedges like gold. iTrustCapital utilizes VaultChain\u0026trade;, investment-grade platinum held physically at the Royal Canadian Mint with ownership managed via a secure blockchain distributed ledger.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"precious-metals"},{"id":"147","name":"TROLL","slug":"troll-sol","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"TROLL","description":"\u003cp\u003eTroll (TROLL) is a meme-based cryptocurrency built on the Solana blockchain, designed to capitalize on internet culture and community-driven engagement. Leveraging Solana\u0026rsquo;s high-speed, low-cost infrastructure, TROLL enables fast and inexpensive peer-to-peer transfers. Like many meme tokens, its value and adoption are primarily driven by social momentum and online communities rather than underlying utility. The TROLL token is mainly used for community participation within the Solana ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"154","name":"Gram","slug":"gram","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"GRAM","description":"\u003cp\u003eGram (GRAM), formerly Toncoin, is the native asset of The Open Network, a decentralized layer-1 blockchain designed to support high-performance applications across payments, wallets, decentralized finance, content distribution, mini apps, and other Telegram-native use cases. The network uses sharding and Proof of Stake consensus to support fast, scalable, low-cost transactions. GRAM is used for transaction fees, staking for network validation, and supporting the network\u0026rsquo;s broader economic model.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"150","name":"Telcoin","slug":"telcoin","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"TEL","description":"\u003cp\u003eTelcoin (TEL) is a blockchain-powered financial platform focused on digital payments, remittance, and mobile-first financial services. The project works to connect blockchain technology with telecommunications and mobile money networks to improve access to low-cost financial tools globally. TEL is the native token used within the ecosystem for transactions, remittance, platform incentives, and decentralized finance applications.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"},{"id":"153","name":"Venice Token","slug":"venice-token","show_on_list":true,"ticker":"VVV","description":"\u003cp\u003eVenice is a privacy-focused generative AI platform designed to give users, developers, and AI agents access to uncensored AI tools and inference through the Venice API. Founded by crypto entrepreneur Erik Voorhees, the ecosystem supports applications focused on private AI interactions, text and image generation, code generation, and decentralized AI access. VVV is the native token associated with the Venice ecosystem.\u003c/p\u003e","asset_type":"crypto"}],"included":["1INCH","APE","PENGU","WLFI","XDC","ASTER","AIOZ","GALA","SUI","CRO","BNB","MNT","ALGO","BERA","IP","TIA","FARTCOIN","HYPE","USDC","AXS","PNUT","JTO","MNDE","TAO","SKY","DASH","CC","AXL","LINK","SEI","OP","ZK","ZEC","STRK","ZRO","PRIME","ADA","AERO","FET","LDO","METIS","MOODENG","FLOKI","INJ","HNT","ONDO","S","FLR","VET","STX","POPCAT","GIGA","ORCA","AAVE","APT","ARB","BONK","PEPE","RENDER","WIF","NEAR","IMX","CHZ","FIL","ICP","AVAX","BAT","BTC","BCH","ETH","ENJ","DOT","DOGE","CRV","COMP","ATOM","GRT","LTC","MANA","POL","SHIB","SAND","SOL","SUSHI","UNI","XRP","XTZ","YFI","XLM","QNT","TRUMP","FLOW","HBAR","KMS","MON","RLUSD","KMG","WLD","ZBCN","TRX","KMPT","TROLL","GRAM","TEL","VVV"]}},"__N_SSG":true},"page":"/","query":{},"buildId":"Ug4jt-WO6_N-8Mxw6xERF","isFallback":false,"gsp":true,"scriptLoader":[]}</script><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||a.contentWindow.document;if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a1b9b2f20d7acef8',t:'MTc4NDEyODI3OQ=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loadin